<BaseLayout current="Projects" title="Projects">
  <div class="eyebrow">BUILDING & EXPERIMENTATION</div><h1>Projects</h1><p class="lede">A record of things I am exploring and building. Status labels are intentional: an ambition is not a completed project.</p>
  <section id="bracket" class="tile" style="margin-top:28px"><span class="eyebrow">IN PROGRESS · EXPLORATORY STUDY</span><h2 style="margin:4px 0 12px">Lightweight Mechanical Bracket</h2><p>Explore how geometry affects the mass, stiffness, stress distribution and manufacturability of a mechanical bracket.</p><p><strong>Planned methods:</strong> CAD · Finite Element Analysis · design comparison · prototype testing.</p><p><strong>Questions:</strong> Can mass be reduced while keeping deformation within an acceptable range? How do constraints and manufacturing methods affect the result?</p><p class="small-note">No validated numerical results are claimed yet.</p></section>
  <section id="lab" class="tile" style="margin-top:18px"><span class="eyebrow">LONG-TERM VISION</span><h2 style="margin:4px 0 12px">Robotics & Innovation Laboratory in Togo</h2><p>An evolving vision for a place where people can study scientific ideas, design mechanical systems, experiment with robotics and build prototypes.</p><p>Possible pillars: research reading groups, mechanical design, prototyping, robotics experiments, technical education and collaboration with industry.</p><p class="small-note">This is a long-term ambition, not an operating laboratory.</p></section>
  <p class="small-note" style="margin-top:30px">More projects will be added when there is concrete work, evidence or a useful lesson to share.</p>
</BaseLayout>